#: ../../../../../../docs/index.md:9
msgid "Nexus 嵌入式平台"
msgstr "Nexus embedded platform"

#: ../../../../../../docs/index.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 提供可复用的 C11 平台机制：Core、Arch、类型化 I/O、静态 factory、可选 OS 和组件。产品任务、私有 "
"PCB、Flash 分区与恢复策略由外部工程拥有。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus supplies reusable C11 platform mechanisms: Core, Arch, typed I/O, "
"static factory, optional OS and components. External projects own product "
"tasks, private PCBs, Flash partitions and recovery policy."

