#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/index.md:23
msgid ""
"当前生产 SoC 包包含 STM32F4 和 "
"STM32F1。板卡、精确料号、模式与限制由[支持参考](reference/platforms/support.md)维护。Native "
"是显式主机测试模型。软件行为、ARM 链接、SDK 消费和物理 HIL 分别记录，当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"The production SoC packages are STM32F4 and STM32F1. The [support "
"reference](reference/platforms/support.md) lists boards, exact parts, modes,"
" and restrictions. Native is an explicit host test model. Software behavior,"
" ARM linking, SDK consumption, and physical HIL have separate records. The "
"current physical HIL status is `not_executed`."

